      "description": "The artefact pages of smart-trust's IG site, generated from `fhir-artifact-index/index.json` by `smart-trust:pages` (`fhir-harness/scripts/gen-ig-pages.ts`) with smart-base's themes, built at publish and never committed. They build into the IG's own site at `/smart-trust/`, under the IG's menu; the IG's own index, toc and artifacts pages are the site's landing pages. `instanceRoot: true` makes this directory answer at `/smart-trust/`. It is declared here, not in `cat-harness.json`, because `compose-docs` treats every docs entry there as a composition layer and would overlay this instance's `index.md` onto the main site's.",
